## Migration Process

### Steps Taken

1. Created `src/lua/` directory structure
2. Copied all files from `/home/ritz/games/azeroth-core/lua-scripts/custom/`
3. Copied extensions from `lua-scripts/extensions/`
4. Removed symlinks from install script
5. Updated install script to copy from `src/lua/` to `installed-files/bin/lua_scripts/`
6. Verified scripts load on server start

### Git History Decision

The original custom/ directory had 119 commits with valuable context about design decisions. Rather than importing that history (complex merge), we took a **snapshot approach**:
- Fresh start in src/lua/
- Original history preserved in wow-chat-1 reference (libs/wow-chat-1/)
- Issue files document "why" decisions were made
- LLM transcripts/ directory captures evolution

