## Phase 1 Contribution

This issue enables **Phase 1: Foundation** by ensuring:
> "The game scripts exist within the project"

Without this, the server runs but the game systems (ambush, treasure, travelers) don't spawn. The scripts are the **game**, not just code. Owning them means owning the experience.
